Location: rust/lichen-core/src/loadng.rs lines 509-513

What is good: RERR parsing rejects unknown error codes:
    if RerrCode::from_u8(error_code).is_none() {
        return Err(LoadngError::InvalidErrorCode(error_code));
    }

This prevents attackers from triggering route deletions with fabricated error reasons. The SECURITY comment at lines 49-52 explains the rationale.

Worth defending - this is defense in depth even though signature validation is the primary control.
